# MSM (Move-Split-Merge) Metric Verification
#
# This library contains formal proofs for the MSM metric for time series,
# proving that MSM is a proper metric (identity, symmetry, triangle inequality).
#
# Namespace: Liblevenshtein.MSM
#
# Dependencies: Coq Standard Library, QArith (rational arithmetic)
#
# Reference: Stefan, Alexandra, et al. "The move-split-merge metric for time series."
#            IEEE TKDE 25.6 (2012): 1425-1438.
#
# Author: Dylon Edwards
# Date: 2025-12-26

-R theories Liblevenshtein.MSM

# Core definitions (base layer)
theories/Core/MsmDefinitions.v
theories/Core/CFunction.v
theories/Core/MsmDistance.v

# Metric property proofs
theories/Metric/Identity.v
theories/Metric/Symmetry.v
theories/Metric/TriangleInequality.v
theories/Metric/MainTheorem.v

# Lower bound proofs (for indexing)
theories/Indexing/LowerBounds.v
theories/Indexing/QuantizationBounds.v
